---
// CursoIngresso.astro - Sub-view 4: Formas de Ingresso na Graduação
import { asset } from '../../lib/paths';
---

<div class="space-y-6 text-[#0A0A0A]">
  <div class="cagp-tool-box p-5 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_#0A0A0A] space-y-4">
    <div class="border-b-2 border-[#0A0A0A] pb-3 flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right text-[#8B1E2D] text-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3 class="font-head text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#0A0A0A] m-0 tracking-wide">
            Processos Seletivos e Formas de Ingresso
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 mt-0.5 font-body font-medium">Conheça as 4 vias oficiais de entrada no Bacharelado em Gestão Pública:</p>
      </div>
      <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-dark font-mono font-bold">
        <i class="bi bi-signpost mr-1" aria-hidden="true"></i> 4 Vias Oficiais
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-body">
      <!-- 1. SiSU -->
      <div class="cagp-card p-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-2.5">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#8B1E2D] text-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <i class="bi bi-pencil-fill text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="font-head font-black uppercase text-xs text-[#8B1E2D] tracking-wide">1. SiSU / ENEM</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-medium m-0">
            Entrada principal de 80 vagas anuais divididas entre o 1º e 2º períodos letivos, com reserva de vagas por cotas sociais e raciais.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href={asset('/documentos/forma-ingresso-sisu.pdf')} download class="text-xs font-head font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8B1E2D] hover:underline mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 no-underline">
          <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-pdf" aria-hidden="true"></i> Guia SiSU (PDF) &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Obtenção de Novo Título -->
      <div class="cagp-card p-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-2.5">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="font-head font-black uppercase text-xs text-[#0A0A0A] tracking-wide">2. Obtenção de Novo Título</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-medium m-0">
            Vagas remanescentes para candidatos com diploma de graduação reconhecido pelo MEC via edital do DRCA.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href={asset('/documentos/forma-ingresso-obtencao-novo-titulo.pdf')} download class="text-xs font-head font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A0A0A] hover:underline mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 no-underline">
          <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-pdf" aria-hidden="true"></i> Guia Novo Título (PDF) &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Reopção de Curso -->
      <div class="cagp-card p-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-2.5">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#005A9C] text-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <i class="bi bi-arrow-left-right text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="font-head font-black uppercase text-xs text-[#005A9C] tracking-wide">3. Reopção Interna</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-medium m-0">
            Destinado a estudantes de outros cursos de graduação da UFMG que queiram migrar para Gestão Pública.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href={asset('/documentos/forma-ingresso-reopcao.pdf')} download class="text-xs font-head font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#005A9C] hover:underline mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 no-underline">
          <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-pdf" aria-hidden="true"></i> Guia Reopção (PDF) &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Transferência Externa -->
      <div class="cagp-card p-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-2.5">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#15803D] text-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <i class="bi bi-send-fill text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="font-head font-black uppercase text-xs text-[#15803D] tracking-wide">4. Transferência Externa</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-medium m-0">
            Para graduandos matriculados em cursos de Gestão Pública ou áreas afins de outras faculdades do Brasil.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href={asset('/documentos/requerimento-transferencia-outra-ies.pdf')} download class="text-xs font-head font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#15803D] hover:underline mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 no-underline">
          <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-pdf" aria-hidden="true"></i> Formulário DRCA (PDF) &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>